{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('stock-master-panel/demo.md')\nnames=['Graham','Buffett','Munger','Klarman','Greenblatt','Fisher','Lynch','T. Rowe Price','Terry Smith','Nick Sleep','Templeton','Marks','Dreman','Zell','Rogers','Bogle','Dalio','Soros','Druckenmiller',\\\"O'Neil\\\"]\nchecks=[('Net asset protection','Need market cap, liquid assets and liability detail; net debt 15 alone cannot establish protection.'),('Durable cash generation','Simplified FCF is 12; need multi-year records and competitive evidence.'),('Business understanding','Need business model and customer concentration; positive cash flow does not prove quality.'),('Downside protection','Need debt maturity and liquidation values before downside analysis.'),('Return on capital / earnings yield','Need EBIT, invested capital and enterprise value; neither metric is computable.'),('Product-led growth','Need product, research and customer records; revenue 100 alone establishes no trend.'),('Growth versus valuation','Need earnings growth and valuation; no PEG computation.'),('Sustainable growth','Need industry expansion and reinvestment evidence.'),('Quality and conversion','Operating cash flow 18 is known; profit and capital returns are missing.'),('Shared scale economies','Need unit costs and customer pricing; revenue does not prove scale benefits.'),('Cross-market contrarian value','Need peer prices, valuation and market comparisons.'),('Cycle and risk','Net debt 15 must be tested against downturn cash flow and maturities.'),('Pessimism priced in','Need valuation history and expectations before a contrarian conclusion.'),('Assets and capital structure','Cash 20 and debt 35 are known; need asset classes and collateral terms.'),('Supply and demand cycle','Industry unknown; cannot assume a commodity cycle.'),('Portfolio cost and concentration','Need total portfolio and fees; single-company data cannot establish suitability.'),('Economic risk exposures','Need holdings and factor exposures; diversification effect unknown.'),('Expectations feedback','Need financing and expectation changes before identifying a feedback loop.'),('Trend and liquidity','Need price history and liquidity data; no timing conclusion.'),('Price-volume and earnings confirmation','Need daily prices, volumes and earnings growth; no technical trigger.')]\ns=p.read_text()+'\\\\n## Twenty-seat execution on the simulated evidence\\\\n\\\\nMethod simulations only; names are indexing labels, not quotations or current views. Method attribution has not been independently researched in this demonstration.\\\\n\\\\n| Seat | Research question | Conditional result and missing counterevidence |\\\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\\\n'\nfor n,(q,r) in zip(names,checks):s+='| '+n+' | '+q+' | '+r+' |\\\\n'\ns+='\\\\n### Synthesis\\\\n\\\\nAll twenty seats remain individually visible. Coverage differs: cash generation can be described, valuation and timing cannot. This is an evidence gap, not a bullish/bearish disagreement; no majority vote is justified. First request original filings and business description, then dated market value and multi-year financials. No real company or market has been researched.\\\\n'\np.write_text(s)\nprint('Twenty-seat simulated execution completed: 20 distinct evidence checks.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
